patrone-hyperv-setup (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First package: at each desktop login in a Hyper-V VM, offers to set up
    what's missing of Hyper-V's integration services and VMConnect's
    enhanced session, with one password, and shows the PowerShell command
    for what Windows needs, with "Don't show this again" (the user,
    2026-10-28: "When the Patrone Linux starts up, have it check for
    Hyper-V and if its using Hyper-V as its host, then provide a prompt
    with an option to install support for Hyper-V, also allow a disable
    future notifications on this dialog box.").

